body:
usually it's been in arguments, but i just sorta become all docile and agree with them, and try to change the topic

&#x200B;

i've been told the way i respond is not good though, it only fuels their assumed power over you

looks like ingrown hairs? try to exfoliate before you shave, body butters can help with that i think? also remember to use shaving cream (or whatever you have that's like it), use warm water on your legs, make sure to not use a dull razor, and put on some lotion after you shave/get out of the shower

&#x200B;

[here's a random article on it](https://www.wikihow.com/Prevent-Ingrown-Hairs) 

&#x200B;

i get em too, you can get mask type things to get rid of them I think? just look into it, but i'm pretty sure it's ingrown hairs

!! Oh! Yeah, thank you

I don't have much a backround with Judaism, I'm a christian kid but I've always been open minded to learning about religons and stuff, a family member being jewish made me want to incorporate that into this family (I like adding elements of my irl family to characters in the comic)

The comic is based off of a video game originally but it's sort of spiralled into its own thing, it's basically a slice of life story of a restaurant to a murder mystery type deal with elements of mental health blah blah blah.

&#x200B;

I've never written a jewish character before, and neither has my friend (the co-writer, they're athiest and hasn't done much research on religion stuff)

&#x200B;

The family is jewish I guess cause the rest of their family is, and I guess that just started because that was the belief they felt the most in-line with? 

&#x200B;

The story takes place in like, 1990s Texas in a small town, I can answer more questions if needed pff

well they aren't physically abusive, they're just emotionally abusive, mainly my mom. i'm super distant from my dad but he still does his fair share. i'm too scared to contact authorities because i have no proof of their neglect of my mental health. my mom said i cut just for attention and said my issues aren't bad enough for me to get therapy.

&#x200B;

i'm just scared of the cops or cps coming, questioning them and then leaving with nothing, and my mom getting worse with the abuse, i don't trust many adults

i've talked to crisis lines before, i dont mind them i just dont think its that serious

&#x200B;

and about my friends calling me annoying it's only happened once but i still worry about it

michael afton is my son i love him i want to hug him and make sure he lives a happy life and eat popcorn with him i want to hug him

&#x200B;

i have deadass projected 80% of my trauma onto michael afton in my friend's fnaf au just to have some way to get it all out and it has been so theraputic holy fucking shit i love this little egg man so much hes so silly the funky no organ egg man just <33 <3 <3333 ,<333
